{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01440","headline":"相和歌辞 江南弄 · 王勃","name":"相和歌辞 江南弄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南弄，巫山连楚梦，行雨行云几相送。\n瑶轩金谷上春时，玉童仙女无见期。\n紫露香烟眇难托，清风明月遥相思。\n遥相思，草徒绿，爲听双飞凤凰曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王勃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01440.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01440","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}